      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "In Utah, a standard professional residential roof inspection typically costs between $130 and $275, with the average baseline landing right around $190 . However, depending on the inspection method, roof layout, and your underlying goals, prices can vary across a broader range from $75 to $600+.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "between $130 and $275"
        ]
      },
      {
